# Fit the name

A service name stays on one line and shows the full text. Use `FitName` from `src/components/fitName/FitName.jsx`.

- The parent is a flex row with a bounded width (`min-width: 0`, `width: 100%`).
- `FitName` keeps `white-space: nowrap` and shrinks the font until `scrollWidth` fits `clientWidth`.
- Short names keep the stylesheet size. Only long names get smaller.
- Measure at medium weight so hover and the chosen state still fit.
- Do not clip the name with ellipsis.
- This covers the services page and the navbar services list.
